      "text": "getEnvironmentUpdate\n\n1. Restore vehicles from STARK state\n2. Create a sandbox HighwayEngine\n3. Inject vehicle states\n4. Use engine.step() for next state\n5. Write back DataStateUpdate",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "getEnvironmentUpdate\n\n1. Restore vehicles from STARK state\n2. Create a sandbox HighwayEngine\n3. Inject vehicle states\n4. Use engine.step() for next state\n5. Write back DataStateUpdate",
