      "updated": 1778512560309,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Meaning of the predicted sequence\n\nAfter the current AI action is approved:\nt0: execute the AI decision\nt1: recovery action, decelerate\nt2: keep decelerating\n...\ntk: traffic state after the k-th decision instant",
