      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Source of uncertainty: getEnvironmentUpdate is determined by engine.step(), so the sequence is approximately deterministic. To model sensor invisibility, getInitialState may omit surrounding vehicles' cooldownTimer, making MOBIL action timing an initial uncertainty.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Source of uncertainty: getEnvironmentUpdate is determined by engine.step(), so the sequence is approximately deterministic. To model sensor invisibility, getInitialState may omit surrounding vehicles' cooldownTimer, making MOBIL action timing an initial uncertainty.",
